/**
 * Demonstration data.
 *
 * EVERY business, person, address, document and bank account below is FICTIONAL. No real
 * identity document, no real bank account and no real personal data appears anywhere.
 * The identifiers are deliberately shaped so they cannot be mistaken for real ones:
 * registration numbers use an RC-DEMO- prefix, account numbers are sequential test
 * patterns, and email addresses use the reserved .invalid TLD which can never resolve.
 *
 * The data is generated by driving the real services rather than by inserting rows. A
 * seeded transaction goes through the same state machine, the same compliance engine and
 * the same ledger postings a live one would, so what a reviewer sees in the demo is what
 * the code actually does.
 */
